WEBVTT

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:11.270
Akiba is being targeted?

00:00:11.270 --> 00:00:15.230
Yeah, by a big, dark guy named Ereinus.

00:00:15.230 --> 00:00:19.020
Litka fought against him,
but he was really strong.

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:20.940
The brave warriors
of the Protector Knights...

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:23.310
...Mush, Enoki, and Porcini...

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:25.520
They all got injured and fell.

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:27.020
Protector Knights?

00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:32.060
Why does it sound like you are
the only one fighting? What about me?!

00:00:32.060 --> 00:00:34.060
Did it happen recently?

00:00:34.060 --> 00:00:36.730
It hasn't even been ten days, Shiro-Shiro.

00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:38.810
"Shiro-Shiro"?

00:00:38.810 --> 00:00:40.850
Was that fight a raid?

00:00:40.850 --> 00:00:45.270
Yep. Since all the monsters in
the Underground Empire went over

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:48.350
to the enemy's side and attacked us,
we were like "forget this!"

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:50.190
So we ran.

00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:51.560
I see.

00:00:51.560 --> 00:00:54.310
Shiro. Is it gonna be okay?

00:00:54.310 --> 00:00:57.810
The sisters are at level 65,
and they could fight fairly okay,

00:00:57.810 --> 00:01:00.690
which means the enemy is level 70 at most.

00:01:00.690 --> 00:01:03.940
It's a lot lower than the
Summoner Genius Tarictan's.

00:01:03.940 --> 00:01:09.150
I see. Well, there are various
kinds of Geniuses, like Camaysar.

00:01:09.150 --> 00:01:11.020
Shiroe...!

00:01:11.020 --> 00:01:14.900
It doesn't seem the matter
is that urgent, but...

00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:18.440
I'll report it to the Round Table
Conference just in case.

