00:03:45.730 --> 00:03:48.520
their characteristics including
equipment and skills,

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:53.100
whether you have extra supplies
or not, battlefield terrain,

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:55.850
and your foe's ability
and their behavior patterns...

00:03:55.850 --> 00:03:59.060
So your decision this time
was correct, Minori.

00:04:00.230 --> 00:04:04.020
Oh...! Yeah, I'm glad!

00:04:04.020 --> 00:04:06.400
Izumo's useless sisters, huh?

00:04:06.400 --> 00:04:08.850
So something really did happen?

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:10.690
Ahh, yeah.

00:04:10.690 --> 00:04:13.730
It just brings back memories.

00:04:13.730 --> 00:04:16.310
You guys passed level 50, right?

00:04:16.310 --> 00:04:17.980
Yep.

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:22.770
The max level for
Elder Tales used to be 50.

00:04:22.770 --> 00:04:26.400
We were all fighting in raids at
level 50 when the game first came out.

00:04:26.400 --> 00:04:28.270
Is that right?

00:04:28.270 --> 00:04:31.520
Even now, raids start around that level.

00:04:31.520 --> 00:04:36.100
So it's about time for you guys
to start participating in raids for real.

00:04:36.100 --> 00:04:38.810
You learn class-specific
supreme skills at level 50 too, so...

00:04:38.810 --> 00:04:42.310
Yep! "Rite of Divine Possession," right?

00:04:42.310 --> 00:04:43.770
What kind of skill is that?

00:04:43.770 --> 00:04:48.440
It powers up all the skills you use
for a given period of time.

00:04:48.440 --> 00:04:49.810
Do you use it?

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:54.270
I've gotten quite used to it,
but its recasting time is long,

00:04:54.270 --> 00:04:56.480
so it's hard to decide when to use it.

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:59.900
It's originally a skill for raids, so...

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:01.600
Really, I'm sorry.

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:02.940
Why?

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:05.230
I've left you guys alone for a while.

00:05:05.230 --> 00:05:09.150
When things calm down a little, I'll take
you on a raid while taking a summer break.

00:05:09.150 --> 00:05:11.100
Really?!

00:05:11.100 --> 00:05:15.400
Err... Yeah. Probably... somehow...

00:05:15.400 --> 00:05:18.810
So make sure you and
the others will be prepared for it.

00:05:18.810 --> 00:05:20.060
Okay!

00:05:23.270 --> 00:05:24.560
Hey, Miss Isuzu.

00:05:24.560 --> 00:05:28.190
Studying magic? You sure are devoted.

00:05:28.190 --> 00:05:31.400
I'm researching practical use
of Flash Needle.

00:05:31.400 --> 00:05:32.980
I see.

00:05:48.020 --> 00:05:50.480
Wh... What'd you do that for?!

00:05:50.480 --> 00:05:53.600
It's not fair that you're
always sparkling!

00:05:53.600 --> 00:05:54.200
Huh?

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:59.480
That's why I want to
decorate you and Minori.

00:05:59.480 --> 00:06:02.150
It's more fun than dressing myself up.

00:06:02.150 --> 00:06:04.900
Even so, why did you pull my ears?

00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:06.690
Touching them relaxes me.

00:06:06.690 --> 00:06:10.100
Jeez... Well, you're in a great mood.

00:06:10.100 --> 00:06:14.770
Yeah. I coordinated Minori's
outfit today, and I'm so proud of it.

00:06:14.770 --> 00:06:19.440
With that outfit, even that
dense Shiroe's heart would flutter.

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:22.900
Don't you think, squad member Rudy?

00:06:24.350 --> 00:06:25.940
What's the matter?

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:27.440
Miss Isuzu.

00:06:27.440 --> 00:06:28.810
What is it?

00:06:28.810 --> 00:06:30.980
About Miss Minori...

00:06:30.980 --> 00:06:33.770
Why don't you stop
encouraging her so much?

00:06:33.770 --> 00:06:39.100
What? Rooting for their friend's
romance is part of the girl code.

00:06:39.100 --> 00:06:44.850
I feel squad member Minori
should have more confidence in herself.

00:06:44.850 --> 00:06:49.100
Jeez... You're so square, Rudy.

00:06:52.650 --> 00:06:55.900
Well then... I'm sorry I stayed long.

00:06:55.900 --> 00:06:57.600
Not at all.

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:07.150
E... Excuse me!

00:07:07.150 --> 00:07:09.980
I'd like to go scouting with you.

00:07:09.980 --> 00:07:11.190
What?

00:07:11.190 --> 00:07:15.480
I'd like to go shopping
to prepare for raids.

00:07:15.480 --> 00:07:18.650
Could you teach me about supplies?!

00:07:20.230 --> 00:07:23.770
Oh no, I shouldn't have asked...

00:07:23.770 --> 00:07:25.940
You're very zealous, Minori.

00:07:25.940 --> 00:07:27.980
Okay. I'll think about it.

00:07:29.310 --> 00:07:31.560
Let's find a time to do it soon.

00:07:32.980 --> 00:07:34.100
Okay!

00:07:37.150 --> 00:07:41.690
So that's what happened. I'm glad
I mustered up the courage and asked.

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:43.730
Good for you, Minori.

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:46.190
But you guys haven't
decided on when, right?

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:46.860
Right.

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:51.520
You must! "I'll think about it"
is one of adults' go-to excuses.

00:07:51.520 --> 00:07:54.350
But when I think that
it'll happen someday,

00:07:54.350 --> 00:07:57.690
that alone makes my everyday life fun.

00:07:57.690 --> 00:08:00.020
Jeez...

00:08:00.020 --> 00:08:02.150
I think this place is good.

00:08:02.150 --> 00:08:04.650
Teacher System, on!

00:08:10.260 --> 00:08:13.260
Human

00:08:10.260 --> 00:08:13.260
Guardian

00:08:10.260 --> 00:08:13.260
Affiliated Guild

00:08:13.850 --> 00:08:15.980
Now, let's start your training!

00:08:15.980 --> 00:08:20.190
I'll participate in the battles
with you today, so let's work together!

00:08:20.190 --> 00:08:22.730
I wanna see the
Mofur sisters' abilities too,

00:08:22.730 --> 00:08:25.190
so Toya and Serara,
you two just watch first.

00:08:25.190 --> 00:08:27.690
Excuse me. About that...

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:30.900
Master! The Mofur sisters aren't with us!

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:32.270
What?

00:08:32.270 --> 00:08:35.520
Sis! That is an edible mushroom!

00:08:35.520 --> 00:08:37.560
We will have mushroom au gratin tonight.

00:08:37.560 --> 00:08:39.980
Truffles! Let us find truffles!

00:08:39.980 --> 00:08:41.940
We're not here for mushroom hunting.

00:08:45.230 --> 00:08:49.100
So what do we have to do?

00:08:46.040 --> 00:08:50.550
Headquarters for
Operation Rescue
and Retrieve Krusty,
 the Former Rep
of the Round Table 
Conference, Who Is 
Fighting Alone on 
the Eured Continent

00:08:49.100 --> 00:08:51.850
Well... How should I put it...?

00:08:50.550 --> 00:08:56.050
Headquarters for
Operation Rescue
and Retrieve Krusty,
 the Former Rep
of the Round Table 
Conference, Who Is 
Fighting Alone on 
the Eured Continent

00:08:51.850 --> 00:08:56.350
It's like a movie where
only the title has been decided.

00:08:56.350 --> 00:08:58.560
It's like "Operation to Bring Back
Mr. Eyeglasses, Who's Fully Enjoying

00:08:58.560 --> 00:09:02.600
A Great Adventure While on Vacation
by Himself on the Eured Continent,

00:09:02.600 --> 00:09:04.270
by Pulling His Ear."

00:09:04.270 --> 00:09:08.940
To begin with, it's not even clear what
kind of goods we need for the expedition.

00:09:08.940 --> 00:09:11.480
If it were raids on the Yamato server
it would've been fine,

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:15.730
but this is our first expedition to
a foreign server after the Apocalypse.

00:09:15.730 --> 00:09:18.060
It's an unprecedented scale.

00:09:18.060 --> 00:09:22.060
We can't predict milord's
next moves at all in the first place.

00:09:22.060 --> 00:09:27.440
It's hard to think he's genuinely
trying to return to the Yamato Server.

00:09:27.440 --> 00:09:30.270
I bet he's still just wandering about.

00:09:30.270 --> 00:09:31.130
True.

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:36.940
He's already had a sword fight with
hero Elias and beaten a Genius as well.

00:09:36.940 --> 00:09:41.270
And when he isn't fighting, he must
be increasing his followers by pointlessly

00:09:41.270 --> 00:09:45.940
being friendly to simplehearted
town girls and cute small animals.

00:09:45.940 --> 00:09:50.850
That's right. I, Elissa,
can tell what he's thinking.

00:09:50.850 --> 00:09:52.810
I can almost see it.

00:09:52.810 --> 00:09:56.520
Maybe we do not need
to go rescue him after all?

00:09:56.520 --> 00:09:59.310
I really feel nothing but worry.

00:09:59.310 --> 00:10:01.940
Please do not worry.

00:10:01.940 --> 00:10:05.900
I'll send in veteran members from D3, too.

00:10:06.900 --> 00:10:09.560
Are you not coming with me?

00:10:09.560 --> 00:10:15.190
I... Well, the place that helps me
to improve my skills is Akiba.

00:10:15.190 --> 00:10:19.600
I must take responsibility
for breaking up D.D.D.

00:10:19.600 --> 00:10:22.100
If I leave Akiba
because I wanna see milord,

00:10:22.100 --> 00:10:24.810
I really won't be able
to look him in the eye.

00:10:24.810 --> 00:10:27.690
Then who will guard the princess?

00:10:27.690 --> 00:10:31.600
I'll do that as well as lecture milord.

00:10:31.600 --> 00:10:34.520
Wow, I envy you.

00:10:34.520 --> 00:10:37.730
Well then, let's discuss
what's required, shall we?

00:10:37.730 --> 00:10:39.060
Okay.

00:10:41.230 --> 00:10:42.980
Mr. William!

00:10:42.980 --> 00:10:44.650
Hm?

00:10:44.650 --> 00:10:47.190
So you're in Akiba today again.

00:10:47.190 --> 00:10:51.100
Yeah. I have to buy items
needed for raids.

00:10:51.100 --> 00:10:54.310
Good timing! May I ask you a question?

00:10:54.310 --> 00:10:59.270
What do raids mean to you?
Anything important to keep in mind?

00:10:59.270 --> 00:11:01.560
That would be, of course...

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:32.830
Let's ask raid pros

00:11:01.800 --> 00:11:10.060
Mr. William, Silver Sword

00:11:02.230 --> 00:11:04.810
...to stay calm at all times.

00:11:04.810 --> 00:11:07.560
Keep your cool, even in a pinch.

00:11:07.560 --> 00:11:10.310
Don't worry your comrades.

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:17.320
Miss Kushiyatama, Path of the Sun

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:12.350
Watch your comrades more than your foe.

00:11:12.350 --> 00:11:17.400
And coordinate what
everyone wants to do, I think.

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:24.830
Mr. Isaac, Black Sword Knights

00:11:17.650 --> 00:11:20.560
In your first raid, you learn
a lot by making mistakes.

00:11:20.560 --> 00:11:24.940
Don't be afraid of dying.
And think hard about why you died.

00:11:24.990 --> 00:11:32.830
Miss Rieze, D3-Hub

00:11:25.190 --> 00:11:27.850
Above all, preparation
and review are the most important.

00:11:27.850 --> 00:11:32.730
After that, you shouldn't get
too hung up on the plan you made.

00:11:34.270 --> 00:11:38.560
The more I learn, the more I realize
there's much more to raids than you think.

00:11:38.560 --> 00:11:43.100
But I have to be thoroughly prepared

00:11:43.100 --> 00:11:45.810
for the day I go shopping with Shiroe!

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:51.520
Seconds please, Nyan-Nyan!

00:11:51.520 --> 00:11:53.230
"Nyan-Nyan"?

00:11:53.230 --> 00:11:55.270
How rude of you to call Master that!

00:11:55.270 --> 00:11:59.940
I kinda hesitate to acknowledge
that Lelia and Litka are older than me.

00:11:59.940 --> 00:12:01.190
Oh, yeah. Minori.

00:12:01.190 --> 00:12:01.940
I know what you mean.

00:12:01.940 --> 00:12:03.150
Are you free this afternoon?

00:12:01.940 --> 00:12:03.150
Nyan-Nyan...

00:12:03.150 --> 00:12:06.480
Do you wanna do the shopping we discussed?

00:12:06.480 --> 00:12:07.370
Whoa-kay!

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:08.230
Hm?

00:12:08.230 --> 00:12:09.810
Wow... Good, good.

00:12:21.690 --> 00:12:25.650
I'm sorry to keep you waiting!

00:12:27.730 --> 00:12:29.770
Let's go to Super Class Market first.

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:31.060
Okay!

00:12:32.400 --> 00:12:34.770
Wow... So many items!

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:38.520
The most important goods when preparing
for raids are resistance potions.

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:41.850
With general Secret
Treasure Class equipment,

00:12:41.850 --> 00:12:45.060
the damage caused by the same
level alignment magic attack

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:48.120
Super Class Market

00:12:42.110 --> 00:12:48.120
Japan Server

00:12:42.110 --> 00:12:48.120
Akiba

00:12:45.060 --> 00:12:48.900
can be reduced by an average
of 25 percent or so.

00:12:48.900 --> 00:12:51.770
It's the kind of equipment
you'd wear into battle.

00:12:51.770 --> 00:12:55.770
Things like Celestial Maiden's Robe
and Spring Crimson Hakama, right?

00:12:55.500 --> 00:13:00.420
Fire

00:12:55.770 --> 00:12:59.060
Of course, that's the average
for the six alignments,

00:12:56.540 --> 00:13:00.420
Frost

00:12:56.790 --> 00:13:00.420
Lightning

00:12:57.040 --> 00:13:00.420
Light

00:12:57.290 --> 00:13:00.420
Poison

00:12:57.540 --> 00:13:00.420
Spirit

00:12:59.060 --> 00:13:02.020
and each equipment
has strengths and weaknesses.

00:13:02.020 --> 00:13:06.270
For example, one reduces fire damage
by 40 percent but is weak against frost.

00:13:06.270 --> 00:13:07.650
Okay!

00:13:07.650 --> 00:13:12.270
It means having info on the raid boss
beforehand puts you at an advantage.

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:16.900
So we should consider its alignment
and prepare the best items for it, huh?

00:13:16.900 --> 00:13:20.690
That's right. But it costs
a lot to get equipment,

00:13:20.690 --> 00:13:22.810
and if you focus only on
reducing the alignment damage,

00:13:22.810 --> 00:13:26.350
the effectiveness of the entire
equipment can get unbalanced.

00:13:26.350 --> 00:13:28.850
Oh, I see.

00:13:28.850 --> 00:13:31.850
As for spells,
they're often for small parties.

00:13:31.850 --> 00:13:36.060
You can protect those nearby, but it's
hard to protect the entire raid unit.

00:13:36.060 --> 00:13:38.060
So what's important there is...?

00:13:38.060 --> 00:13:40.600
Supplies like potions.

00:13:40.600 --> 00:13:46.190
Correct. They're gone once used, but
their short-term effectiveness is strong.

00:13:46.190 --> 00:13:48.650
If you use resistance potions,

00:13:48.650 --> 00:13:53.310
alignment attack power gets cut
by 15 percent or so for about 15 minutes.

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:55.020
That makes a big difference!

00:13:55.020 --> 00:13:57.480
Though I'm a little
worried about my budget.

00:13:57.480 --> 00:14:00.230
Hmm... High-end products are expensive,

00:14:00.230 --> 00:14:04.650
but what you should prepare now
is level 50-60 items, so--

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:04.650
There are more digits...

00:14:04.650 --> 00:14:06.020
Hm? Hey!

00:14:06.020 --> 00:14:07.900
They're cheaper than I thought!

00:14:07.900 --> 00:14:10.230
Y-Yeah.

00:14:10.230 --> 00:14:13.520
What am I gonna do? I often hear
there are couples who break up

00:14:13.520 --> 00:14:15.940
due to differences of opinion over money.

00:14:15.940 --> 00:14:21.190
No! No! That's not the point!
He's giving a lecture for me!

00:14:21.190 --> 00:14:23.650
Antidotes and revival orbs
are also important.

00:14:23.650 --> 00:14:26.230
Healers' spells can do both,

00:14:26.230 --> 00:14:31.100
but conversely, Healers' burdens
can be reduced by using these.

00:14:31.100 --> 00:14:32.730
Maybe you need about this much.

00:14:32.730 --> 00:14:34.850
Oh nooooo!

00:14:34.850 --> 00:14:37.810
So these are the general supplies.

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:42.560
You want each of the 24 members
to have at least ten of each item.

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:46.310
After getting these,
you'll prepare items for each class.

00:14:46.310 --> 00:14:50.230
I can carry all these
in my magic bag, but...

00:14:50.230 --> 00:14:53.230
...are raids always like this?

00:14:53.230 --> 00:14:55.560
I heard that when Shiroechi went to Ezzo,

00:14:55.560 --> 00:15:00.980
he brought 300 members
worth of raid supplies.

00:15:00.980 --> 00:15:06.480
I guess they are like that...
because Shiroe prepares that much... Yeah!

