00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:06.120
{=3}Oden

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:06.120
{=2}Oden

00:19:06.650 --> 00:19:08.350
Nothing unusual is happening on this end.

00:19:08.350 --> 00:19:13.900
We've been on guard for at least a week,
but there's no sign of this Ereinus guy.

00:19:13.900 --> 00:19:15.560
I see.

00:19:15.560 --> 00:19:17.230
Isn't it just a groundless rumor?

00:19:17.230 --> 00:19:20.440
It's coming from those
useless sisters, right?

00:19:20.440 --> 00:19:22.650
I don't think so.

00:19:22.650 --> 00:19:26.150
Well, even if this guy really shows up,
he's at level 70 or so, right?

00:19:26.150 --> 00:19:29.560
Even a ragtag team
of drunks would be enough.

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:31.940
Later, then.

00:19:43.730 --> 00:19:46.440
So you were here, Minori.

00:19:46.440 --> 00:19:47.940
Akatsuki!

00:19:47.940 --> 00:19:49.850
You're quite zealous, working till late.

00:19:49.850 --> 00:19:54.100
It's not like that. I can't memorize them
unless I organize them thoroughly.

00:19:54.100 --> 00:19:55.600
Got a minute?

00:19:55.600 --> 00:19:59.400
I need to have the member in
front of me to use the Teacher System.

00:19:59.400 --> 00:20:05.150
Okay. That's right,
you'll be chaperoning us tomorrow.

00:20:01.970 --> 00:20:05.260
Teacher System

00:20:05.260 --> 00:20:07.260
Human

00:20:05.260 --> 00:20:07.260
Assassin

00:20:05.260 --> 00:20:07.260
Affiliated Guild

00:20:05.260 --> 00:20:07.260
Log Horizon

00:20:07.690 --> 00:20:09.940
You're already getting ready for it?

00:20:09.940 --> 00:20:13.770
When I reduce my level,
it affects my movements as well.

00:20:13.770 --> 00:20:16.770
So I need to check it
by actually moving around.

00:20:21.770 --> 00:20:23.940
She's amazing...

00:20:23.940 --> 00:20:26.480
How did the shopping with my lord go?

00:20:26.480 --> 00:20:27.850
What?

00:20:28.310 --> 00:20:30.440
Did it benefit you?

00:20:30.440 --> 00:20:32.650
Yes, a lot.

00:20:32.650 --> 00:20:35.440
I see. I'm glad to hear that.

00:20:37.520 --> 00:20:39.690
Hm?

00:20:39.690 --> 00:20:42.270
It's kind of...

00:20:42.270 --> 00:20:45.230
When it comes to raids,
I'm a beginner, too.

00:20:45.230 --> 00:20:46.940
What?

00:20:46.940 --> 00:20:49.770
I've only been in two raids.
The Byakumaru incident and the Shibuya one.

00:20:49.770 --> 00:20:53.560
I wanna be stronger
to be useful to my lord.

00:20:56.440 --> 00:20:59.350
I, too...!

00:20:59.350 --> 00:21:04.600
I, too, want to be useful to Shiroe!

00:21:04.600 --> 00:21:06.940
You're working hard, Minori.

00:21:06.940 --> 00:21:11.190
Since my lord is your teacher,
you'll definitely become strong.

00:21:13.940 --> 00:21:15.440
Thank you!

00:21:17.350 --> 00:21:23.020
I wonder what Shiroe thinks
when he participates in a raid...

00:21:23.020 --> 00:21:25.850
I wonder what sorts of things he sees...

00:21:25.850 --> 00:21:28.520
I want to catch up to him soon.

00:21:30.350 --> 00:21:31.690
But...

00:21:40.520 --> 00:21:42.980
Good morning!

00:21:45.810 --> 00:21:47.230
Hm?

00:21:57.020 --> 00:21:58.940
This is strange.

00:22:00.020 --> 00:22:01.810
Minori!

00:22:01.810 --> 00:22:05.730
Glad you're here! I wondered
what happened since I didn't see anyone.

00:22:05.730 --> 00:22:07.440
You didn't see anyone, either?

00:22:07.440 --> 00:22:09.770
We can't find the adults.

00:22:09.770 --> 00:22:11.230
What?

00:22:11.230 --> 00:22:13.230
The Mofur sisters, either,

00:22:13.230 --> 00:22:17.150
when they're usually the
first ones to show up for breakfast.

00:22:17.150 --> 00:22:19.690
The color of the sky is kinda odd, too.

00:22:19.690 --> 00:22:24.850
Something really does feel off.

00:22:24.850 --> 00:22:27.230
This is an attack!

00:22:27.230 --> 00:22:28.980
What?

00:22:28.980 --> 00:22:31.980
Akiba is being attacked!

00:22:33.190 --> 00:22:36.850
Attacked...? By who?

00:22:38.440 --> 00:22:41.020
By Genius Ereinus!

00:24:13.310 --> 00:24:15.810
The attack by Ereinus has begun.

00:24:15.810 --> 00:24:19.020
Akiba becomes a strange space
where monsters are rampant.

00:24:19.020 --> 00:24:22.810
Adventurers' levels get reduced,
causing them to be defeated.

00:24:22.810 --> 00:24:26.440
Though being cornered,
Shiroe finds a faint ray of hope

00:24:26.440 --> 00:24:30.020
and hands the baton to Minori,
Toya, and the other young adventurers.

00:24:29.980 --> 00:24:36.990
Next Time

00:24:29.980 --> 00:24:36.990
Labyrinth in Akiba

00:24:30.020 --> 00:24:32.190
Next Time: "Labyrinth in Akiba."

00:24:32.190 --> 00:24:34.980
When things go past the
breaking point, rules change!
